 (text ".subckt D1N5819 k a\nD1 a k MD1N5819\n.model MD1N5819 D(Is=31.7u Rs=0.051 N=1.373 Cjo=110p M=0.35 Eg=0.69 Xti=2 BV=40 IBV=1m)\n.ends\n.subckt DTVS k a\nD1 a k MDTVS\n.model MDTVS D(Is=1e-12 Rs=0.3 N=1.5 BV=20 IBV=1m Cjo=500p)\n.ends\n.subckt DZ12 k a\nD1 a k MDZ12\n.model MDZ12 D(Is=1e-14 Rs=8 N=1 BV=12 IBV=5m Cjo=50p)\n.ends\n.subckt DLED k a\nD1 a k MDLED\n.model MDLED D(Is=1e-19 N=1.6 Rs=5)\n.ends\n.model DBODY D(Is=1e-12 Rs=0.01 BV=55)\n.model NLZ44 NMOS(Level=1 Vto=1.5 Kp=10 Lambda=0.002 Rd=0.006 Rs=0.004)\n.model PF4905 PMOS(Level=1 Vto=-3 Kp=12 Lambda=0.002 Rd=0.005 Rs=0.003)\n.subckt IRLZ44N g d s\nM1 d g s s NLZ44\nDb s d DBODY\nCgs g s 1.5n\nCgd g d 0.2n\n.ends\n.subckt IRF4905 g d s\nM1 d g s s PF4905\nDb d s DBODY\nCgs g s 3n\nCgd g d 0.6n\n.ends\n.subckt PC817 a k e c\nDled a m DOPTO\nVs m k 0\nFph c b Vs 0.005\nQp c b e QOPTO\nRbe b e 200meg\n.model DOPTO D(Is=8.4e-13 N=2 Rs=2 Cjo=30p)\n.model QOPTO NPN(Is=1e-14 Bf=200 Vaf=100 Cjc=15p Cje=10p Tf=5n)\n.ends" (at 300.00 250.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3a30a008-e976-47e9-8540-ce32e2ddc3f0))
 (text ".tran 20u 400m" (at 300.00 150.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e448429b-8fbb-4502-839d-f70e8d285c6f))
 (text "Simplified models, same as simulation/normal.cir.\nTimeline: ARM on at 20 ms, FIRE1 on at 30 ms, FIRE1 off at 280 ms, ARM off at 310 ms.\nR19 = fuse F1, R20/L3 = battery and lead, L1+R31 = solenoid 1, L2+R32 = solenoid 2, R21..R23 = GPIO output resistance, R40 = ESP32 load.\nPlot: V(/VSW), V(/D1N), V(/G1), V(/G3), I(L1), V(/SWSENSE), V(/VSENSE)" (at 300.00 140.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0566246c-193f-4e0d-aacc-2aee212e641f))
